[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_v8n6h")
dialogue_id = "mq_3_30_end"
record_title = "Era 三: A Helping Paw"
text = "PAGE: scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY), historian(STUDIO_SECONDARY)
scribe: The beasts of the wilds walk among us in peace.
scribe: We are finally connecting with the Enlightened One's fractured spirit.
historian: I haven't noticed anything divine about these animals yet.
historian: But perhaps it's too early to tell.
historian: And besides, it's nice not to worry about the wildlife raiding town granaries every night.

PAGE: explorer(CONVERSATION), historian(STUDIO_SECONDARY), scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY)
explorer: Hello there!
explorer: I hope I am not interrupting.
historian: Ah, the wanderer returns.
historian: How are the far shards doing?
historian: Get into any interesting trouble recently?
explorer: You know me, Historian.
explorer: Nothing like a bit of trouble to keep the spirit alive!
explorer: Still, I'm here on business.
explorer: I heard you are looking into the wildlife, and I've got a story I think you both should hear.

PAGE: explorer(CONVERSATION), scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY), historian(STUDIO_SECONDARY)
explorer: So I was camping by this waterfall.
explorer: The folks living around those parts say the waterfall's got a special fish.
explorer: Now, I know it sounds far-fetched, but they say it isn't just any fish.
explorer: They swear it's a spirit!
explorer: Apparently their ancestral legend speaks of a carp that will one day ascend a waterfall and turn into a dragon.
explorer: And this fish is a carp who can't stop jumping up the stream.
explorer: Do you think there's something in this?
scribe: A dragon...
scribe: If ever there was a beast noble enough to embody the Enlightened One's spirit, the dragon would be the obvious choice.
scribe: The ancestors had much wisdom, and for this news to reach us now, when we are looking for the Enlightened One's spirit among the beasts...
scribe: This must be a sign."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
